# Storage — S3 / MinIO

## Abstraction

- `STORAGE_PROVIDER=s3` (default) or `minio` — factory in `storage.factory.ts`.
- API: inject `StorageService` (wraps `STORAGE_SERVICE` port).
- Worker: `ObjectStorageService` — separate copy, same env vars.

Feature code must **not** call `@aws-sdk/*` directly.

## Presigned URLs

```ts
await storageService.getPresignedUploadUrl(key, mimeType, expiresIn)
await storageService.getPresignedDownloadUrl(key, expiresIn)
```

Signing uses public URL env (`MINIO_PUBLIC_URL` / `AWS_S3_PUBLIC_URL`) when set so browsers avoid internal endpoints.

## Object key layout

```
uploads/{stateId}/{districtId}/{ulbId}/{wardId}/survey/{surveyId}/{uuid}.ext
imports/...
exports/...
```

Use `StorageService.buildKey()` for survey photo uploads.

## Validation

- Images: jpeg, png, webp only. Magic-byte check on upload.
- Max size: `UPLOAD_MAX_FILE_SIZE_BYTES` / `STORAGE_MAX_FILE_SIZE_BYTES` (default 5MB).

## Env (validated in `env.validation.ts`)

MinIO: `MINIO_ENDPOINT`, `MINIO_ROOT_USER`, `MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD`, `MINIO_BUCKET`, …  
AWS: `AWS_REGION`, `AWS_S3_BUCKET`; static keys optional (instance role supported).

Local dev: MinIO via `docker compose up` (port 9000/9001).
